Package: MERLIN
Title: Mutation-Enriched RNA Profiling via Long-Read Integration
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sebastian", "Eder", , "edersk.merlin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Detects single nucleotide variants (SNVs) from Oxford Nanopore
    long-read single-cell RNA sequencing data. Processes FASTQ files to extract
    cell barcodes and UMIs, identifies SNVs at user-defined regions of interest,
    performs UMI error correction via Levenshtein distance, and classifies cells
    as mutant or wild-type with optional SNP-based phasing for definitive versus
    ambiguous wild-type resolution.
